  "releaseNotes": "Release v2.14.1.0\n- #1937: Migrating from v3 to v4 automatic MSI authoring issue\n- #1933: WixTools.SfxCAFor return 64 bit property for !is64\n- #1928: [BUG]Adding a Extension DLL with a full path cuases a crash\n- Manifest's dependency pack Microsoft.Net.Component.4.7.2.TargetingPack is replaced with Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.CoreEditor.\nThis is to allow to install on both VS2022 and VS2026. Related to #1929.",
